- music.mood | does: The best licensed track for a mood, under the whole post. | needs: A mood from the list; a post that names a partner only gets tracks cleared for brand work. | settings: mood (one of hype, warm, reflective, bright, driving, dark, playful, uplifting, none) | cost: $0 (licensed, already in the bucket) | likeness risk: none | use when: A reel or story: the mood the moment carries. none when the post should be quiet. | don't use when: A mood with no track cleared for this post plays no music; the preview says so. | NOT measured: As a kit choice: the track is the catalogue's best for the mood; nobody has listened to the picks yet.
LOOKS — one look for the whole post
- look.preset | does: One colour look on every photo and clip of the post; natural changes nothing. | needs: A look name from the list. | settings: name (one of natural, warm, cool, vivid, muted, mono) | cost: $0 (one colour filter — nothing is generated) | likeness risk: none | use when: Every post. Prefer natural unless the brief or the pictures clearly call for another. | don't use when: A strong look on a picture that is already filtered stacks on top of it. | NOT measured: Each name is one fixed filter, the same on clips and photos; no cast check on clips yet.
AUTOMATIC — the app does these on its own; do not ask for them
- caption: The post's hook laid over the opening of a reel or story, inside the safe zones. Needs: A hook of 80 characters or fewer with nothing in it the post must avoid.
PAID — SHE DECIDES (never in the preview; only ever a button she taps)
